Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.54,0:00:03.65,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Gah! What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.33,0:00:09.24,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Eww. They're covered in moldy stains!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.57,0:00:11.53,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.69,0:00:15.38,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It must be because of \Nthat leak in the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.38,0:00:16.68,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Oh crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.68,0:00:20.28,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Like, aren't we screwed? \NThe festival is the day after tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:24.46,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Let's just throw them all \Nin the washing machine and—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:25.50,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No, don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.97,0:00:29.01,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,If you don't clean the stains \Nand mold before washing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:31.64,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I don't think you'll ever get them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.27,0:00:34.46,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Then what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.21,0:00:41.02,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll treat the stains \Nand then wash them all myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.62,0:00:43.52,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Will you make it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:45.15,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Maybe if I stay up all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.36,0:00:50.28,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I know you need these \Ngarments for the festival, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.51,0:00:55.03,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You can count on Kinme!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.38,0:01:17.48,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\fs36\c&HB8B74C&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz8.498\\clip(160,82,167,129)\t(16,893,1 \clip(153,76,277,123))\pos(164,88)\fad(1,187)} Wash {\c&H121A2E&}It
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:17.48,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\fs36\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz8.498\clip(269,73,271,114)\pos(282,71)\fad(1,187)\clip(267,73,276,116)\t(6,1007,1,\clip(275,58,417,107)\c&H121A2E&}All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.54,0:02:31.51,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(481,478)\fs13\shad2\c&H222C04&\3c&HEEDCCF&\blur0\bord1.5\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\4c&HC7CD96&\pos(496,65)}Episode {\c&H8065C7&}5 {\c&H020201}I Have a {\c&HA49F43&}Feeling{\c&H020201}...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:36.51,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnArial\shad0\c&H95DBDE&\3c&H717877&}Kinme Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.87,0:02:54.15,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.15,0:02:55.28,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:02.77,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\b1\c&H555152&\3c&HE7E8E9&\pos(321,128)\fs30}Start
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:02.52,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\b1\c&H555152&\3c&HE7E8E9&\fs30\pos(323,263)}Pause
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:07.36,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,I went ahead and put the ones \Nthat were ready in the washer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.36,0:03:08.78,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.78,0:03:12.80,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Sure. I'll take the ones \Nthat have been washed upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.64,0:03:18.41,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I really appreciate you \Nstaying so late to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.41,0:03:20.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Are you all going to be okay \Nfor school tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.70,0:03:24.05,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Oh, sure. We'll be totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.26,0:03:29.06,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,But I mean, do you still have a lot \Nof work to do to get the mold out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.34,0:03:31.15,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, it seems so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.69,0:03:31.57,sign_5028_33_Potassium,text,0,0,0,,Potassium
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.86,0:03:35.07,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,One round of stain removal \Nisn't cutting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.32,0:03:41.33,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Mold is composed mostly of \Norganic ingredients,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.33,0:03:45.58,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,so I apply a neutral detergent at \N13% concentration directly to the mold
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.58,0:03:47.50,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,and then spray it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:50.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But after that, \Nthere's still some discoloration,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.84,0:03:54.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,so I have to oxygen-bleach that out \Nand try all sorts of treatments.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:58.26,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Jeez. And you have \Nto do them all one by one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.26,0:04:01.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, the stains are different \Nfor each one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.64,0:04:05.78,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I have to keep that in consideration when \Ndeciding how much detergent to apply.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:08.02,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Serious? How annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:12.27,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, it is. But as annoying as it can be,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.87,0:04:16.02,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,when I think about what I'm restoring
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:19.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,and all the festival memories \Nthese outfits hold for people,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.30,0:04:20.88,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm happy to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:27.46,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm going to do a little more \Nand then take a break myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.46,0:04:30.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,so when you're done with those,\N go ahead and call it a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.96,0:04:34.14,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Please tell the boys they can go too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.14,0:04:35.45,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:40.72,Italics,Kuriru (M),0,0,0,,Kinme-san sure does love cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.18,0:04:42.85,Italics,Kuriru (M),0,0,0,,Meanwhile, this one here...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.29,0:04:48.71,Italics,Kuriru (M),0,0,0,,is sleeping on the job. \NWhat a little baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.71,0:04:55.07,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Kinme-san, I... made a delicious \Nmidnight... snack for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:02.57,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnVerdana\shad0\c&HECE4D7&\3c&H827F7E&}Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.32,0:05:05.45,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,'Sup. Making progress?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.74,0:05:07.54,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:10.63,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,'Kay, here's the last of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.63,0:05:13.71,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Kinme-san said she'd handle the rest,\N so we can go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.23,0:05:15.35,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,How's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.35,0:05:18.01,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,She's still working on the mold stains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.01,0:05:21.34,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,I knew this would've been \Ndifficult for her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.57,0:05:25.97,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,But I mean, what is \NKinme-san's story anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.03,0:05:27.76,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:32.70,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Like, wasn't this place \Nabandoned for years?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.70,0:05:35.78,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,And I don't think Kinme-san \Nis from around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.78,0:05:36.44,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:41.20,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think she said she moved \Nto Atami two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:45.82,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Hmm, really? Just to open a cleaning shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:49.08,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Dunno. She didn't say why.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:53.24,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,My memory only goes back two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:56.09,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,It seems I washed\N all my older memories clean away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:03.76,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,So you don't know either, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.75,0:06:06.69,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm pooped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.69,0:06:09.77,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,I'm gonna head home \Nand get some sleep. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:11.31,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.09,0:06:19.30,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Kinme-san! We're taking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.30,0:06:22.26,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Oh, should we come back to help tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.77,0:06:26.53,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I think I can handle the rest \Nby myself. Thank you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:28.48,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Sorry about my dumb brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.48,0:06:32.04,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,He made rice but didn't put \Nanything together to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:33.38,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:37.04,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But thank you for everything today. \NIt really helped!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.93,0:06:48.64,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Kuriru-chan really does act \Nlike the older one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.19,0:06:53.21,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,I mean, for a boy, you are so scrawny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.90,0:07:03.19,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'd better get some rest \Nbefore I wear myself out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.83,0:07:06.67,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You should probably start \Nheading home, Kyusho-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.67,0:07:08.95,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll hang up the rest myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:11.95,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Actually, this is the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.77,0:07:15.65,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Good. Finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:22.42,Italics,Kyusho,0,0,0,,She has to treat stains, wash,\N hang clothes to dry, and then iron them,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.72,0:07:24.71,Italics,Kyusho,0,0,0,,while also making pickups and deliveries?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.71,0:07:28.68,Italics,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Cleaning is a lot more \Nlabor-intensive than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.07,0:07:31.43,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm all done, Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:07.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh shoot! I must have dozed off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.37,0:08:13.66,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,The lights are off.\N Has Kyusho-kun already left?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.47,0:08:18.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yeah, he might have \Ncaught me sleeping again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.73,0:08:24.98,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\shad0\c&H5E606C&\3c&HEAEDEE&\fad(1,935)}Please don't work too hard
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:01.59,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\b1\c&H555152&\3c&HE7E8E9&\pos(321,128)\fs30}Start
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:01.34,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\b1\c&H555152&\3c&HE7E8E9&\fs30\pos(323,263)}Pause
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:28.34,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H4E7F37&\3c&H98CDC4&\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman}We Pick Up and Deliver!\N{\c&H447087&\3c&H86BAB1&\fnArial\b1}Kinme Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:44.61,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnVerdana\shad0\c&HECE4D7&\3c&H827F7E&\fad(1,694)}Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.87,0:09:59.42,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:06.75,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnVerdana\shad0\frx8\fry340\c&H0F0E0E&\3c&H7A8B93&\fs30\frz3.142\pos(284,141)}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:10.10,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,When I talked to her, \Nshe said they were all ready to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.10,0:10:13.60,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,so I thought we should come \Nand help her carry them, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:15.26,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Is she even here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.77,0:10:25.52,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Kinme-san, are you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:32.28,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,What a messy sleeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:47.43,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,By the way, I wanted \Nto apologize about yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.43,0:10:49.79,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,I was gonna cook up \Na midnight snack but fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.79,0:10:53.05,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, it's all right.\N I ended up falling asleep myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:58.55,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,And Kyusho-kun saw \Nhow sloppily I sleep again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.91,0:11:03.86,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hi, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.73,0:11:06.63,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.11,0:11:15.42,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Wow, you can't tell \Nthat they were moldy at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:18.14,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kinme-san. \NTalk about professional work!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.14,0:11:19.66,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,They look brand new.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:21.12,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.12,0:11:23.18,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Seriously, thank you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:25.49,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Kyu told me how much work it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.49,0:11:26.89,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.89,0:11:30.62,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I never would've made it without the help\N of Kyusho-kun and his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.02,0:11:33.88,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I am glad that everyone \Nis pleased, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.51,0:11:41.14,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Kinme-oneesan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.14,0:11:43.64,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, Nairo-chan! Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:45.18,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.18,0:11:49.06,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I couldn't stay to see \Nall of your rehearsal the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:50.38,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,That's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.38,0:11:54.11,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,You got busy washing \Nall of the happi coats for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:55.64,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.45,0:11:59.95,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Are you going to come \Nand see the parade tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:04.59,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, I think so. I'm planning \Nto come and watch after work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.59,0:12:06.20,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Kinme-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:14.96,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:18.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Look at you all! You really look the part!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:20.58,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kinme-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.58,0:12:23.51,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,We hope you can come and see us in action!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:25.39,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Right, Kyu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.82,0:12:27.92,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Uh... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.83,0:12:33.74,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,It is time once again for\N the Kogashi Festival float competition!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.74,0:12:38.03,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Let's go win the wooden dashi category\Nonce again this year!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:40.53,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.53,0:12:42.44,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.44,0:12:44.35,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Let's get hyped up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.04,0:12:51.96,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(418,244)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:56.96,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(80,24)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.97,0:13:04.58,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Here, Poly-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:10.56,Default,Female Customer,0,0,0,,Good morning, Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:14.54,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Come on in. Are you here to \Npick up the suit? It's ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.54,0:13:17.23,Default,Female Customer,0,0,0,,I'm so glad we have \Ngood weather for the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.15,0:13:19.15,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.23,0:13:21.67,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.82,0:13:38.50,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,All right! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.50,0:13:39.76,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:17.29,Default,People,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:25.55,Default,People,0,0,0,,Heave-ho! Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.23,0:14:28.05,Default,People,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.71,0:14:38.63,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Heave-ho, heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:55.00,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.83,0:15:00.34,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnVerdana\shad0\c&H0C3E64&\3c&H5290BC&\fs30\t(\fs26)\pos(327,149)}We are closed for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:16.60,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs12\c&H322416&\3c&HBAA997&\shad0\move(223,8,286,8,0,3102)}Atami  {\b1\fs21\c&H3D268A&\3c&H000000&}Kogashi Festival{\b0} {\fnArial\fs16\c&H000000&\3c&HBAA997&}Float Competition {\fnTrebuchet MS\fs12\b1}Judging Area{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.63,0:15:43.11,Default,People,0,0,0,,Heave-ho! Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.11,0:15:46.13,Default,Men,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.39,0:15:58.40,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs30\shad0\b1\an9\c&H3E849F&\3c&HCBFEFB&}Atami
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.40,0:16:03.40,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&H99ABC5&\frz89.87\fscx113\fscy1\pos(39.5,177)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
