Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.40,0:16:03.40,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs14\c&H284879&\3c&HFBF9F8&\pos(29,303)}No.\N1\N2\N3\N4\N5\N6\N7\N8\N9\N10\N11\N12\N13\N14\N15\N16\N17
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.40,0:16:03.40,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs14\an7\c&H284879&\3c&HFBF9F8&\pos(47,52)}Decorative Float Category/Designation\NThe Summer and the Festival Reunited! \NBig Parade! Anniversary 25! \NShine On! The Starry Parade Miracle \NParade of the Hot Spring Floats \NClash of the Light and Water! Kogashi Wars Returns! \NUtopia at the End of the Festival: Atami Fantasy Road \NThe Atami Onsen Monsters Are Here! \NHot Studs Reborn 2026! \NThirty-Six Views of Mt. Fuji: Big Wave in the Atami Ocean \NCheers to Atami! Lantern Fantasy! \NDance of Fire! The Atsuo Firestorm! \NSummertime Steam-Blasting Dragon! \NIt's the Kogashi Festival Lantern Float! \NShine Brightly! Blossom Proudly! \NReady to Sail into a New Age! Children Are Atami's Treasure \NSummer Cherry Blossoms in Full Bloom in Atami!\NAtami Onsen Avengers: Save the World with Hot Water
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.21,0:16:13.68,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.54,0:16:18.04,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, Nairo-chan's grandmother? \NGood evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.51,0:16:21.77,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Aren't the floats wonderful this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.77,0:16:22.54,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.54,0:16:26.93,Default,Youth,0,0,0,,Hurray! Hurray!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.93,0:16:44.31,Default - Top,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Heave-ho! Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.24,0:16:30.33,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Look, it's Nairo and the kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:41.16,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Nairo, you're doing great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:42.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Nairo-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.34,0:16:51.78,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.70,0:16:50.57,Default - Top,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.49,0:16:56.91,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:05.30,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Heave-ho! Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.30,0:17:09.40,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,They're all going to have \Nsuch fond memories of this night,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:11.80,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,wearing the happi coats I washed for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.32,0:17:17.89,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.39,0:17:23.02,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Oh, Kinme-san! Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.85,0:17:21.76,Default - Top,Moruda,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.08,0:17:33.74,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,For some reason, I have a feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.53,0:17:36.97,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,this night will become \Na fond memory for me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.83,0:17:42.25,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.72,0:17:44.83,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Hello, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.83,0:17:47.21,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Whoa, nice timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.14,0:17:51.01,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Why doncha help us \Npull the float, Kinme-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:52.07,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.07,0:17:54.28,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,We're about to turn around and go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.28,0:17:55.86,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh, is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.86,0:17:59.39,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Of course! \NAnd how about a beer as thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.39,0:18:03.02,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh... I'd better not drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.02,0:18:06.65,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,You sure? Anyway, come and join in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.19,0:18:08.15,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.02,0:18:14.91,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Kinme-san, take this. \NIt's from our neighborhood association.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.91,0:18:16.28,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh... all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.79,0:18:28.55,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Here we go! Ready and...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.16,0:18:45.81,Default,All,0,0,0,,One, two! One, two!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.11,0:19:01.36,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Nice work, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.36,0:19:04.04,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Thanks! I'm beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.04,0:19:06.56,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Oh! Great job, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.23,0:19:09.93,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hello! You were all great today!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.93,0:19:13.39,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Kinme-san again. You too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.39,0:19:15.34,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Yeah, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:18.93,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Wait, you don't have a beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.09,0:19:22.18,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm not much of a drinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.18,0:19:26.92,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Okay, so, what did you think? \NDidn't I look cool up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:28.69,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,I really got into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.69,0:19:33.47,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, you all looked very cool, \Nway up on the top of the float like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.47,0:19:34.69,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Very impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.69,0:19:38.54,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Aw, man! You seriously \Nthought I looked cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:39.93,Default - Top,Man,0,0,0,,Kuriru-chan, Moruda-kun, \Ncould I borrow you a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:41.14,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,I mean, you really inspired me, Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.07,0:19:41.95,Default - Top,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.14,0:19:43.33,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Just call me Moruda, lord of the float!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.33,0:19:45.16,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,What are you mumbling about anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.71,0:19:52.55,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Would you like to get on the float?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.05,0:19:53.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.24,0:19:56.59,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What? Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.59,0:20:00.92,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,With a mask on, nobody will know it's you. \NShould be no problem at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.59,0:20:02.58,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.63,0:20:07.10,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I really hope this is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.80,0:20:13.17,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,You can use that ladder to get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.17,0:20:14.88,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:25.87,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, I'd better put the mask on first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.99,0:20:39.63,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:41.30,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.53,0:20:47.39,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Kinme-san! Kyu! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.39,0:20:49.57,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Did you tell her to climb on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.57,0:20:51.53,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Don't you know how dangerous that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.53,0:20:52.62,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.62,0:20:54.63,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Are you really okay, Kyu?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.63,0:20:56.60,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.60,0:20:58.28,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.70,0:21:01.78,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Are you sure you aren't injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.78,0:21:03.28,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.28,0:21:08.29,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But I am a little embarrassed \Nfor causing such a fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.56,0:21:10.43,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:13.79,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, no. It was my fault too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.05,0:21:19.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,U-Um, I'm really not hurt at all, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.96,0:21:23.20,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Kyusho-kun risked his neck to catch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.20,0:21:25.56,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Just what were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.56,0:21:27.56,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,I said I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.56,0:21:30.02,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Kinme-san's never done this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:32.60,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,You've got to keep an eye on her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:34.56,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,This could have been a lot worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.03,0:21:34.56,Default - Top,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah, uh, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.85,0:21:37.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Kyusho-kun, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.82,0:21:40.82,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh... sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.15,0:21:43.92,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Kinme-san, I really am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.54,0:21:47.58,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm not hurt at all, \Nso please don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.79,0:22:00.75,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(353,354)\shad0\fnArial\fs10\bord1.5\c&H4A83BA&\3c&HF0FBFF&\b1\pos(443,293.467)}Translation:\NEditing and Typesetting:
