Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.79,0:22:05.76,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(353,354)\shad0\fnArial\fs10\bord1.5\c&H4A83BA&\3c&HF0FBFF&\b1\pos(455,230.462)}Riley Dalton\NSriram Gurunathan
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.47,0:23:29.35,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,You were wonderful up there! \NWe were all so impressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.35,0:23:31.72,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I'm all burnt out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:39.98,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\c&H020201&\bord0\pos(315,155)}Episode {\c&H8A80CC&}6 \h\h{\c&HA49F43&}Pop, {\c&H020201}Pop, Boom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.81,0:23:39.05,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Next time is "Pop, Pop, Boom."
